{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34712","headline":"夏日闲居作四声诗寄袭美 平上声 · 陆龟蒙","name":"夏日闲居作四声诗寄袭美 平上声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝烟淹楼台，晚雨染岛屿。\n渔童惊狂歌，艇子喜野语。\n山容堪停杯，柳影好隐暑。\n年华如飞鸿，斗酒幸且举。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34712.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34712","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}